# iTerm2 mutates this directory constantly (sqlite DBs, sockets, downloaded
# Python runtimes, saved state). Version only the hand-written auto-launch
# scripts, like k9s/ does for its config.
#
# Ignore everything, then re-include the Scripts tree one level at a time —
# git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded.

*
!.gitignore

!Scripts/
Scripts/*
!Scripts/AutoLaunch/
Scripts/AutoLaunch/*
!Scripts/AutoLaunch/*.py
